# Optional keys for job-scout sources. Copy to ~/.hermes/job-scout/.env or
# to your Hermes ~/.hermes/.env, then fill in only the ones you want.
# The daily scan works without any of these: free sources still run.
# Do not commit a filled .env.

# Google Jobs via SerpAPI. Free trial keys are available at:
# https://serpapi.com/
SERPAPI_API_KEY=

# Adzuna country job search. Register at:
# https://developer.adzuna.com/
# Country is chosen from the profile locations (ca, us, gb, ...). You can
# override it here.
ADZUNA_APP_ID=
ADZUNA_APP_KEY=
ADZUNA_COUNTRY=

# USAJobs (US federal roles). Request an API key at:
# https://developer.usajobs.gov/
# USAJOBS_USER_AGENT must be an email address, as required by their API.
USAJOBS_API_KEY=
USAJOBS_USER_AGENT=

# Hermes itself needs a model key and a Telegram bot token to deliver the
# digest. Those are configured during `hermes setup` and
# `hermes gateway setup`, and live in ~/.hermes/.env. Examples:
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
# TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_USERS=
